cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "Exact Pole Placement for a ZOH-Discretized Extended State Observer: Noise-Aware Auditing with a JONSWAP Case Study"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation for an implementation-level analysis of a third-order
  extended state observer that combines exact zero-order-hold state prediction with a
  bandwidth-parameterized innovation gain vector. The workflow reproduces the exact
  characteristic-polynomial defect, the corrected gain vector, the disturbance-increment
  input channel, the separation of three noise measures, and the JONSWAP case study.
